{"type":"message","id":"70baf12f","parentId":"d2169eb4","timestamp":"2026-05-22T00:00:26.629Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Git add 和 commit 成功了，但 git push 失败了，因为找不到 ssh 命令。这是一个常见问题 - git remote 使用 SSH 协议但系统没有安装 OpenSSH。\n\n我需要解决这个问题。可能的解决方案：\n1. 使用 HTTPS 替代 SSH remote\n2. 安装 openssh-client\n\n让我先检查一下当前的 remote 配置，看看能否改成 HTTPS。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nGit commit 成功但 push 失败——SSH 未安装。让我检查 remote 并切换到 HTTPS：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-5f51efb9-22c7-4fbf-a49a-cd29c7cc7aff","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw && git remote -v"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"cd ~/.openclaw && git remote -v\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":13136,"output":121,"cacheRead":480,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13737,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779408023267,"responseId":"chatcmpl-196b6455-45fc-4056-a2bb-66a73309f8dd"}}
