{"type":"message","id":"6a9d65ea","parentId":"3f016d1d","timestamp":"2026-05-22T00:00:38.677Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No SSH, no GitHub credentials configured. The backup couldn't complete. I need to notify the boss about this - the cron ran but failed because there's no way to authenticate to GitHub.\n\nThe commit succeeded, so the data is safe locally. But the push to GitHub failed.\n\nLet me report this to the boss so they can set up authentication.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n备份失败——commit 成功但 push 到 GitHub 失败：\n\n- **问题：** 没有 SSH 客户端（`ssh: No such file or directory`），也找不到 GitHub 认证凭证\n- **现状：** commit 已生成，但未推送到远程\n\n**需要解决：**\n- 要用 SSH → 安装 `openssh-client`\n- 要用 HTTPS → 配置 GitHub token（`gh auth login` 或 `git config credential.helper`）\n\nBoss 需要哪种方式？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":205,"output":172,"cacheRead":13696,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14073,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779408033882,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ab5658f2-acfd-4c71-ae4a-cac2fd5c9b2d"}}
